/ActualText (Congratulations on receiving the keys to your new condo! Taking Vacant Possession \(VP\) is an exciting milestone. However, before you move in or hand over the unit to your renovation contractor, it is crucial to conduct a thorough defect check \(commonly known as "snagging"\). Identifying and reporting defects now ensures the developer rectifies them for free under your Defect Liability Period \(DLP\), preventing costly repairs and avoiding delays to your IdealHub renovation timeline.)
/K [2]
/S /Span
/Type /StructElem
/P 810 0 R
/Pg 5 0 R
>>
endobj
