/ActualText (1. Mark It \024 Place a piece of masking tape next to every defect and write a brief description \(e.g., 'Hollow tile', 'Scratch on glass'\).)
/K [5]
/S /Span
/Type /StructElem
/P 3927 0 R
/Pg 3061 0 R
>>
endobj
