3928 0 obj
<<
/ActualText (2. Photo Document \024 Take clear, well-lit photos of each defect. Include a wide shot \(to show location\) and a close-up \(to show the defect\).)
/K [6]
/S /Span
/Type /StructElem
/P 3929 0 R
/Pg 3061 0 R
>>
endobj
