/ActualText (3. Fill the Form \024 Complete the developer's official defect liability form. Be specific, list every item, and attach your photos. Submit this to the Developer's Customer Care Centre or the Joint Management Body \(JMB\) / Management Corporation \(MC\).)
/K [7]
/S /Span
/Type /StructElem
/P 3931 0 R
/Pg 3061 0 R
>>
