<<
/ActualText (4. Keep a Copy \024 Always retain a dated, stamped copy of the submitted form. Follow up within the stated timeframe \(usually 14\02330 days\).)
/K [8]
/S /Span
/Type /StructElem
/P 3933 0 R
/Pg 3061 0 R
>>
